'CBLAS3.PER'     NAME OF SUMMARY OUTPUT FILE
9                 UNIT NUMBER OF SUMMARY FILE
'CBLAS3.snap'     NAME OF SNAPSHOT OUTPUT FILE
-1                UNIT NUMBER OF SNAPSHOT FILE (NOT USED IF .LT. 0)
F        LOGICAL FLAG, T TO REWIND SNAPSHOT FILE AFTER EACH RECORD.
F        LOGICAL FLAG, T TO STOP ON FAILURES.
T        LOGICAL FLAG, T TO TEST ERROR EXITS.
16.0     THRESHOLD VALUE OF TEST RATIO
5                 NUMBER OF VALUES OF N
8 16 32 64 128 256       VALUES OF N
1                 NUMBER OF VALUES OF ALPHA
(0.7,-0.9)       VALUES OF ALPHA
1                 NUMBER OF VALUES OF BETA
(1.3,-1.1)       VALUES OF BETA
CGEMM  T PUT F FOR NO TEST. SAME COLUMNS.
CSYMM  T PUT F FOR NO TEST. SAME COLUMNS.
CTRMM  T PUT F FOR NO TEST. SAME COLUMNS.
CTRSM  T PUT F FOR NO TEST. SAME COLUMNS.
CSYRK  T PUT F FOR NO TEST. SAME COLUMNS.
